  "description": "Operating Area: India\n\nBoarding Point: Jetty no 5, opp. Taj Mahal Hotel, Gateway of India.\n\nFerritti one of the most popular brands in the world of cruising, a yacht that speaks for its own elegance and style beautifully manufactured with fibreglass, wooden flooring and crafted with Italian interiors made up of leather and wood.\nThe motor yacht has a Fiberglass (GRP) hull and superstructure with a beam of 6 meters and a 1,85 meter draft.\nShe has a cruising speed of 28 knots, a max speed of 32 knots.\nShe can accommodate up to 10 guests in her 4 suite cabins for an overnight experience, Model 80 includes, 1 Master Cabin, 1 VIP Cabin and 2 Twin Cabins.\nBeing an 80 footer the capacity of the yacht for day cruising or parties is maximum upto about a 40 people on board addition to a captain and 3 crew members on board.\nThe yacht has a music system & DVD player and a huge Bluetooth speaker which can be used for parties while cruising.\nThe kitchen is fully furnished with a fridge, oven and a microwave along with cooking facility, basic crockery, cutlery, glasses on board. The yacht has a spacious upper deck (fly bridge) with seating capacity for a 15 - 20 guest, covered with a canopy and tables in the center along with cushioned sofa seating, the view from the upper deck is breath taking and gives u a complete dimension of the Mumbai harbour due to its height.\nThe bow of the boat is sleek, has the sun bathing pads and comfortable space for 10 people to sit together for selfies, perfect one for a couple photo shoot.\nThe wooden flooring helps you to balance and move comfortably on the entire yacht, the rear deck can fit another 10-15 people at a time, the rear deck is the single entrance to the interiors of the yacht which starts from a Ac saloon area with soft cushioned leather seats, wooden consoles moving into a 8 seater dining area.\nThe yacht is chartered for special celebrations of birthdays, anniversaries.\nHaving a good capacity for a big group, we have lots of corporate get together and parties on the yachts.\nFerritti 80 is a beauty of its own which speaks for elegance, luxury, space and seamless performance on the Mumbai harbour\nThe yacht is very popular for photo shoots for pre wedding, short add films, movies, day trips or even destination trips to Mandwa (Alibaug)\nThe above price includes a transfer boat ride to the yacht, once you reach the yacht there will be 120 mins (2 hours) of charter time (1 hour cruising and 1 hour anchor) and then again, one is sent back on the same transfer boat to the shore.\nPreferred Morning slots: 7 to 9 am and 9am to 11am\nEvening Slots: 2 to 4pm, 4 to 6pm, 6 to 8pm or 8 to 10 pm (No 5 to 7pm available)\n3rd hour and 4th hour requirement can be discussed if required with the customer care before booking for better deals.",
